# Community plugins vendored into plugins/ by scripts/update-plugins.sh.
#
# Format: one "<repo> <ref> [subdirs]" per line. <repo> is a repository under
# https://github.com/mantisbt-plugins ; <ref> is a tag, branch, or commit SHA.
# The script resolves <ref> to an immutable commit SHA, downloads that SHA's
# tarball, and vendors a pristine copy into plugins/. See plugins/VENDOR.md for
# the resolved SHAs and AGENTS.md for the add/remove/update procedures.
#
# The optional third field is a comma-separated list of subdirs to vendor, for
# repos that don't map one-to-one onto plugins/<repo>:
#   - source-integration ships several plugins as top-level subdirs
#   - TelegramBot carries its plugin in a TelegramBot/ subdir
# With no third field the whole repo becomes plugins/<repo>.
#
# FieldDescriptions is repo-owned (not listed here) and is never touched.
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

VEditor v1.1.2
Announce v2.4.6
Motives master
SetDuedate main
LinkedCustomFields v2.0.2
CustomizeEmailSubject master
InlineColumnConfiguration v2.0.0
